    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d371-a1-a8">

                <pb facs="0544" n="470" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg470"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">G.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Statement of</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">I.</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">S. Ludlam.</hi></head>
                <p>I am a citizen of the United States. I was master of the steamer Firefly during
                    the time of her charter to the Chinese government up to the date of her capture.
                    I had then resigned and Captain Dolle was about taking charge. I have probably
                    taken as much pains as any one in Shanghai to ascertain the circumstances of hey
                    capture and the names of her captors.</p>
                <p>I am positive in my conviction that Burgevine had nothing to do with it.</p>
                <closer><signed>I. S. LUDLAM.</signed></closer>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">Sworn to before me, at
                            <placeName>Shanghai</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-08-03">this 3d day of August, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                    <signed>O. B. BRADFORD, <hi rendition="#italic">Clerk of
                    Court.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d371-a1-a8-a1.xml" xpointer="d371-a1-a8-a1"/>
